<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1454864598"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1517690564"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Good Things Fall Apart vs. Sad Songs"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Jon Bellion / Said The Sky / Annika Wells"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ASCEND (Tour Edits)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="06:06.252"><div begin="00:06.250" end="05:37.103"><p begin="00:06.250" end="00:09.067" itunes:key="L1">Told me I shouldn't watch, got in your car<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我别再留恋</span></p><p begin="00:09.067" end="00:12.733" itunes:key="L2">Then we were nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坐上你的车 然后我们就两不相欠</span></p><p begin="00:12.733" end="00:15.621" itunes:key="L3">All the nights in your room, shit we got through<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们在你房间度过的所有夜晚</span></p><p begin="00:15.621" end="00:18.968" itunes:key="L4">Left in your dust, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却被你遗忘在尘埃里</span></p><p begin="00:18.968" end="00:22.312" itunes:key="L5">Don't know what you got, but I thought we had it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道你有什么感受 但我以为我们坠入了爱河</span></p><p begin="00:22.312" end="00:26.011" itunes:key="L6">Now I'm supposed to act like it doesn't matter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我本应装作若无其事 就此翻篇</span></p><p begin="00:26.011" end="00:28.899" itunes:key="L7">But I'm writing it down, getting it out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我要将我的爱写下来 发泄感情</span></p><p begin="00:28.899" end="00:32.091" itunes:key="L8">Here's to me hoping<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍怀着希望</span></p><p begin="00:32.091" end="00:36.195" itunes:key="L9">Someday I'll come home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天会有所归属</span></p><p begin="00:36.195" end="00:38.880" itunes:key="L10">And feel like no one's even gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会再觉得被人抛弃</span></p><p begin="00:38.880" end="00:42.781" itunes:key="L11">Play this at my shows<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会在表演时唱起这首歌</span></p><p begin="00:42.781" end="00:45.416" itunes:key="L12">And know that I've been moving on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会明白我已放下过往 继续向前</span></p><p begin="00:45.416" end="00:52.162" itunes:key="L13">Someday I'll go to bed and I'll forget I'm lyin' in your spot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天我躺到床上 不会再想起我曾这样依偎在你怀里</span></p><p begin="00:52.162" end="00:57.885" itunes:key="L14">But until someday comes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但直到那样一天到来</span></p><p begin="00:57.885" end="01:00.418" itunes:key="L15">I'll be writing sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一直写悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="01:00.418" end="01:07.106" itunes:key="L16">Ooh, ooh</p><p begin="01:07.106" end="01:12.477" itunes:key="L17">Ooh, ooh</p><p begin="01:12.477" end="01:14.247" itunes:key="L18">Did I say something wrong?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说错什么话了吗</span></p><p begin="01:14.247" end="01:15.869" itunes:key="L19">Did you hear what I was thinking?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你听见我的心声了吗</span></p><p begin="01:15.869" end="01:17.493" itunes:key="L20">Did I talk way too long<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是不是话太多了 当时我只想把所有感受都告诉你 那天晚上</span></p><p begin="01:17.493" end="01:22.540" itunes:key="L21">When I told you all my feelings that night?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当那晚我将所有感受一并告知与你</span></p><p begin="01:22.540" end="01:24.182" itunes:key="L22">Is it you? Is it me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你吗 是我吗</span></p><p begin="01:24.182" end="01:25.806" itunes:key="L23">Did you find somebody better?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否遇见了更优秀的人</span></p><p begin="01:25.806" end="01:27.529" itunes:key="L24">Someone who isn't me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个人不是我吧 我知道 我从来都不是你喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="01:27.529" end="01:31.683" itunes:key="L25">'Cause I know that I was never your type<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我知道我从来都不是你喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="01:31.683" end="01:36.283" itunes:key="L26">Never really your type<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不是你喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="01:36.283" end="01:42.921" itunes:key="L27">Overthinking's got me drinking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思虑太多 只能用酒精麻痹自己</span></p><p begin="01:42.921" end="01:50.369" itunes:key="L28">Messing with my head, woah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的脑子陷入混乱</span></p><p begin="01:50.369" end="01:53.763" itunes:key="L29">Tell me what you hate about me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你讨厌我什么</span></p><p begin="01:53.763" end="01:57.057" itunes:key="L30">Whatever it is, I'm sorry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管是哪一点 我都想说句抱歉</span></p><p begin="01:57.057" end="02:00.401" itunes:key="L31">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="02:00.401" end="02:03.745" itunes:key="L32">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="02:03.745" end="02:06.886" itunes:key="L33">I know I can be dramatic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我可以再浪漫夸张一点</span></p><p begin="02:06.886" end="02:10.433" itunes:key="L34">But everybody said we had it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但大家都说我们够梦幻了呀</span></p><p begin="02:10.433" end="02:13.776" itunes:key="L35">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="02:13.776" end="02:15.803" itunes:key="L36">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="02:15.803" end="02:19.219" itunes:key="L37">I'm coming to terms with a broken heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心碎不已 我终于认清现实</span></p><p begin="02:19.219" end="02:23.750" itunes:key="L38">I guess that sometimes good things fall apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许有时 美好易逝吧</span></p><p begin="02:29.112" end="02:30.817" itunes:key="L39">When you said it was real<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我说这一切都是真的 我想我对你深信不疑</span></p><p begin="02:30.817" end="02:32.541" itunes:key="L40">Guess I really did believe you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我也确实信了你的话</span></p><p begin="02:32.541" end="02:34.116" itunes:key="L41">Did you fake how you feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的那些感觉都是装出来的吗 那天晚上我们把车停在河边</span></p><p begin="02:34.116" end="02:39.132" itunes:key="L42">When we parked down by the river that night?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那晚我们在河边停留的片刻</span></p><p begin="02:39.132" end="02:42.476" itunes:key="L43">That night, that night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天晚上</span></p><p begin="02:42.476" end="02:45.820" itunes:key="L44">When we fogged up the windows in your best friend's car<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天晚上 我们在你好朋友的车里缠绵 车窗蒙上一层雾水</span></p><p begin="02:45.820" end="02:51.900" itunes:key="L45">'Cause we couldn't leave the windows down in December<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为那时是12月 我们没有把车窗摇下来</span></p><p begin="02:51.900" end="02:57.066" itunes:key="L46">Woah</p><p begin="02:57.066" end="03:00.358" itunes:key="L47">Tell me what you hate about me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你讨厌我什么</span></p><p begin="03:00.358" end="03:03.750" itunes:key="L48">Whatever it is, I'm sorry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管是哪一点 我都想说句抱歉</span></p><p begin="03:03.750" end="03:07.041" itunes:key="L49">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="03:07.041" end="03:10.377" itunes:key="L50">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="03:10.377" end="03:13.518" itunes:key="L51">I know I can be dramatic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我可以再浪漫夸张一点</span></p><p begin="03:13.518" end="03:17.068" itunes:key="L52">But everybody said we had it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但大家都说我们够梦幻了呀</span></p><p begin="03:17.068" end="03:20.460" itunes:key="L53">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="03:20.460" end="03:22.486" itunes:key="L54">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="03:22.486" end="03:25.830" itunes:key="L55">I'm coming to terms with a broken heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心碎不已 我终于认清现实</span></p><p begin="03:25.830" end="03:29.529" itunes:key="L56">I guess that sometimes good things fall apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许有时 美好易逝吧</span></p><p begin="03:29.529" end="03:32.822" itunes:key="L57">Good things fall apart, good things fall apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美好易逝吧</span></p><p begin="03:32.822" end="03:36.248" itunes:key="L58">Good things fall apart, good things fall apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美好易逝吧</span></p><p begin="03:42.877" end="03:49.514" itunes:key="L59">Overthinking's got me drinking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思虑太多 只能用酒精麻痹自己</span></p><p begin="03:49.514" end="03:57.044" itunes:key="L60">Messing with my head, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的脑子陷入混乱</span></p><p begin="03:57.044" end="04:00.385" itunes:key="L61">Tell me what you hate about me (Tell me)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你讨厌我什么</span></p><p begin="04:00.385" end="04:03.780" itunes:key="L62">Whatever it is, I'm sorry (Oh, I'm sorry)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我</span></p><p begin="04:03.780" end="04:07.086" itunes:key="L63">Yeah, yeah, yeah (Oh, I'm sorry)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢我很抱歉</span></p><p begin="04:07.086" end="04:10.379" itunes:key="L64">Yeah, yeah, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢我很抱歉</span></p><p begin="04:10.379" end="04:13.571" itunes:key="L65">I know I can be dramatic (I know I can be)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我可以再浪漫夸张一点</span></p><p begin="04:13.571" end="04:17.104" itunes:key="L66">But everybody said we had it (Woo)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但大家都说我们够梦幻了呀</span></p><p begin="04:17.104" end="04:20.398" itunes:key="L67">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="04:20.398" end="04:23.714" itunes:key="L68">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="04:23.714" end="04:27.866" itunes:key="L69">Ooh (Tell me), ooh</p><p begin="04:27.866" end="04:30.399" itunes:key="L70">I'll be writing sad songs (Tell me)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一直写悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="04:30.399" end="04:34.655" itunes:key="L71">Ooh, ooh</p><p begin="04:34.655" end="04:38.556" itunes:key="L72">I'll be writing sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一直写悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="04:38.556" end="04:47.862" itunes:key="L73">(Tell me, tell me)</p><p begin="04:47.862" end="04:51.832" itunes:key="L74">I'll be writing sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一直写悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="04:51.832" end="04:57.109" itunes:key="L75">(Tell me, tell me)</p><p begin="05:02.514" end="05:03.700" itunes:key="L76">(Oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我你讨厌我什么</span></p><p begin="05:03.700" end="05:07.041" itunes:key="L77">Tell me what you hate about me (Tell me)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你讨厌我什么</span></p><p begin="05:07.041" end="05:10.417" itunes:key="L78">Whatever it is, I'm sorry (Oh, I'm sorry)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管是哪一点 我都想说句抱歉</span></p><p begin="05:10.417" end="05:13.710" itunes:key="L79">Yeah, yeah, yeah (Oh, I'm sorry)</p><p begin="05:13.710" end="05:17.054" itunes:key="L80">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="05:17.054" end="05:20.245" itunes:key="L81">I know I can be dramatic (I know I can be)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我可以再浪漫夸张一点</span></p><p begin="05:20.245" end="05:23.693" itunes:key="L82">But everybody said we had it (Woo)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但大家都说我们够梦幻了呀</span></p><p begin="05:23.693" end="05:27.088" itunes:key="L83">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="05:27.088" end="05:29.163" itunes:key="L84">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="05:29.163" end="05:32.456" itunes:key="L85">I'm coming to terms with a broken heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心碎不已 我终于认清现实</span></p><p begin="05:32.456" end="05:37.103" itunes:key="L86">I guess that sometimes good things fall apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许有时 美好易逝吧</span></p></div></body></tt>